          "description": "Ariel, the fun-loving and mischievous mermaid, is enchanted with all things human. Disregarding her father’s order to stay away from the world above sea, she swims to the surface, and in a raging storm, rescues the Prince of her dreams. \n\nDetermined to be human, she strikes a bargain with the sea witch Ursula and trades her fins for legs. With her best friends Flounder and Sebastian at her side, Ariel tries to win the prince’s love and save her father’s kingdom.",
